; Generated by scripts/generate-flt-norm-degrees.py; checked native terms.
; Construct a complete proof-carrying norm degree from
; input zero/leading data: zero for bothzero,2*dp or2*dq+3 for
; a single nonzero input, and the actual maximum for two nonzero
; inputs. Every output includes the actual norm equation/certificate.
